OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry to start with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud. Dry throughout the
OL,7,Fafternoon with bright of sunny spells
OL,8,Fwith any showers confined to the fair
OL,9,Fwest. Breezy, especially over the
OL,10,Fhills.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBecoming cloudier through
OL,13,Fthis evening with a band of rain
OL,14,Fpushing through overnight, followed by
OL,15,Fshowers. Breezy and feeling less mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA day of sunny or bright
OL,18,Fspells and scattered showers. These
OL,19,Fpossibly turning heavy at times with
OL,20,Fthe risk of hail and thunder. Breezy,
OL,21,Fespecially around any heavy downpours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
