OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FStayed mixed during Thursday and
OL,7,FFriday with slow-moving heavy
OL,8,Fdownpours with the chance of thunder.
OL,9,FMore settled through Saturday with
OL,10,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
